abstract: >-
  An interactive System Dynamics educational and research-prototype platform
  for atmospheric carbon accumulation, fossil-carbon lock-in, upstream
  investment dynamics, comparative policy experiments, and a historically
  calibrated reduced-form atmospheric CO2 response.
